+	/*
+	 * AP-side i2s0 playback/capture path. Unlike the VBC card above
+	 * (which rides the audcp agcp_dma), this uses the AP-owned ap_dma.
+	 * Disabled by default; the board dts enables ap_dma, i2s0 and this
+	 * card.
