+	/*
+	 * SDA3/SCL3 carry the TOP-DVFS engine's autonomous I2C channel to
+	 * the FAN53555 (DCDC_CPU1). Live stock Android has these pads at
+	 * func-sel 0 ("func1"), the same value as every other real I2C pad
+	 * (SCL0/SDA0, SCL1/SDA1, SCL6/SDA6) - see
+	 * docs/dvfs-working-regmaps/stock_pinconf_pins.txt. The earlier
+	 * func4 setting here (a misread of the stock DT overlay) routed the
+	 * pads AWAY from the I2C function, so the engine's FAN53555
+	 * transaction never reached the wire and DCDC_CPU1 parked at
+	 * STATE_I2C=4. Applied via cpudvfs_dev probe.
+	 */
+	dvfs_i2c_pin_func: dvfs-i2c-pin-func {
